# Pair Networks

> Buy a domain, get reliable website hosting, and launch with affordable web design. Everything you need to build and grow your online presence, backed by 30+ years of independent, US-based hosting.

Pair Networks is an independent web hosting company with data centers in Pittsburgh, PA and Denver, CO. Services span domain registration, shared and VPS hosting, managed WordPress hosting, professional email, and custom web design and ongoing site management.

## Hosting
- [Shared Hosting](https://www.pair.com/shared-hosting/): Shared web hosting plans for personal sites, blogs, and small businesses.
- [WordPress Hosting](https://www.pair.com/wordpress-hosting/): Managed WordPress hosting with one-click installs, automatic updates, and performance tuning.
- [VPS Hosting](https://www.pair.com/vps-hosting/): Virtual private servers with dedicated resources and root-level control.
- [Help Me Choose](https://www.pair.com/help-me-choose/): Guided comparison to pick the right hosting plan.

